# #5837: the link obligation is durable with the narrow, so a restarted donor re-drives
# the link.
MODULE: SplitEventuallyLinkedObligationLostOnRestart
TARGET: SplitEventuallyLinked
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the donor's link obligation is held in memory, so a restart after L's close loses it and L is never linked (transfer condition (a))
PERTURBS: LinkRestart
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithSplitBirth = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithMixedVersion = FALSE, WithDuplicate = FALSE, WithDonorRestart = TRUE

--- FIND
    /\ ~lRestart
    /\ lRestart' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~lRestart
    /\ lRestart' = TRUE
\* MUTATION: the obligation is not durable.
    /\ oblig' = FALSE
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tRecs, dNarrowed, sDone, dKnown, dResumed, oblig, lat, eagerG, repair, tried, oWin, oHops, birthAct, fxVars>>

(***************************************************************************)
(* The reachability latch
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED <<tRecs, dNarrowed, sDone, dKnown, dResumed, lat, eagerG, repair, tried, oWin, oHops, birthAct, fxVars>>

(***************************************************************************)
(* The reachability latch
--- END
